{"ID":"20240220132632-3nfmyj2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132632-3nfmyj2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132632-3nfmyj2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162825-dldvrsv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162750-ps4enca\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162825-vfjwqtv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【真武汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312162825-dldvrsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-dldvrsv","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第九十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-5p5ipzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-5p5ipzn","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,发汗,汗出不解。其人仍发热,心下悸,头眩,身润动,振振欲擗地者,「真武汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-qeoiys4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-qeoiys4","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真武汤与苓桂术甘汤都可以治疗晕眩，差异在哪里？苓桂术甘汤是治疗中焦的水饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-zjo4blu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-zjo4blu","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3——2"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-536eduw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-536eduw","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝是在通冲脉。桂枝能够降逆，降逆就是气往上冲，桂枝能够把它压下来，加上白术茯苓把这个湿排掉，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"苓桂术甘汤是治疗中膈的水饮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-57mxftq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-57mxftq","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真武汤也是头昏眩，头很重，上重下轻，好像要摔倒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤是温中除寒，所以真武汤用附子。因为附子是热药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-g7j0rml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-g7j0rml","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-h6rndsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-h6rndsf","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓三两，芍药三两，生姜三两，白朮二两炙，附子一枚炮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-74sgwap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-74sgwap","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味,以水八升,煮取三升,去滓,温服七合,日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-qk23nph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-qk23nph","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子一枚差不多三钱。苓桂术甘汤的时候，茯苓是四，白术是二。白术是去湿，茯苓是把湿消导到小便排掉。你如果说，不开茯苓光开白术，去湿没错，湿还在里面出不来。如果开茯苓就是跟药说，湿从小便排出来。这个人本身是下焦寒，肾阳不够的时候，所以我们用炮附子。炮附子下去把水就气化掉了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一方面我们要利水，一方面要把水的温度增加，小便才会导出来。导出来又怕里虚掉，所以用芍药跟生姜来做补药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真武汤就是这样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-uwivgri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-uwivgri","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种人需要真武汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中湿之人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，伤寒论里面说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中风伤寒，温病，还有湿热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。平常就湿气很盛的人。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"湿伤于下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是你久坐湿地。你居住的地方比较潮湿，从下面开始伤到的，平常都是身体湿很盛，一喝热汤，一动就开始不断的流汗，一天换好几身衣服，这是中湿的人。湿很盛的人水没办法出去，你光苓桂术甘汤清不出去的，湿在里面已经太久了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太久了就会变成寒湿，这种情况湿很盛，人会头昏眼花，晕眩很厉害，这个时候也是真武汤症，肌肉闰动也是真武汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真武汤跟苓桂术甘汤差异就在这里，遇到寒湿的人，头昏就是真武汤症，遇到中膈有水就是苓桂术甘汤，苓桂术甘汤没有寒湿。寒湿脉比较细、比较小，比较慢，脚是冷的，不口渴，湿很盛的人没有什么胃口，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脚没有力，因为湿伤于下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如说脚风湿关节炎，两个踝骨或膝盖的关节。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-kr17464","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-kr17464","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么会伤到膝关节？我们有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三个阴骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，叫骨三阴论，出自黄帝外经。一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头顶，小孩子两三岁后收合的骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳朵后面的骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膝盖骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这三个是骨的三阴的所在。湿伤于下会伤到下面的阴骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-ng60jrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-ng60jrj","updated":"20240312162825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子用到的时候，一定是温阳化水，湿在里面，用炮附子下去把它加温。白术去湿，茯苓去水。张仲景利水的时候，很少用甘草，因为这个甘草，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不管是甘草还是炙甘草，它有蓄水的功能。所以我们津液不够的时候，我们会用甘草生津。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在排水，加甘草干嘛。所以五苓散、真武汤没有甘草。我们在治积水、水肿的时候不用甘草。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162825-vfjwqtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162825-vfjwqtv"}},{"ID":"20240312162750-1awfeoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-1awfeoj","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百三十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-d2wiwt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-d2wiwt2","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」二三日不已，至四五日，腹痛，小便不利，四肢沉重疼痛，自下利者，此为有水气，其人或咳，或小便利，或下利，或呕者，「真武汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-z438yq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-z438yq2","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“「少阴病」二三日不已，至四五日，”就是病慢慢深入下去了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"伤寒论只要出现“或”，就是讲有时候有这个症状，有时候没有这个症状。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-32sxjmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-32sxjmu","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真武汤和附子汤很接近。把附子汤里面的人参拿掉，换成生姜就是真武汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤是里寒用的，小便不利，关节四肢沉重使用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-0jegq10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-0jegq10","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“腹痛”，经方在看腹痛的时候，当然真武汤有白芍，不过主要还有炮附子在里面作用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痛是寒，里面有淤血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。但是如果只开活血化瘀的药，没有开去寒的药，这个痛不会去，所以一定要去寒。腹痛的时候，不单单是白芍，炮附子下去，所以有芍药甘草附子汤。热药是去寒用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-g67tenn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-g67tenn","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个汤就是里面水气很盛，自己已经在排了，会自己下利。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水气停在里面，小便不利，小便小不出来，自下利，从大便排出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。沉重疼痛，里面是寒湿很盛。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-q0sq4oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-q0sq4oq","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真武汤症，里面水不排掉，一动的时候，头会很昏。真武汤症里面寒湿的时候，水盛的时候会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头重脚轻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的感觉。常常要晕倒的感觉。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-fb11noh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-fb11noh","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-npvwvqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-npvwvqq","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓三两。芍药三两。生姜三两。白朮二两。附子一枚炮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-ajqbw2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-ajqbw2g","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水八升，煮取三升，去滓，温服七合，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-bod3khz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-bod3khz","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真武汤的时候，茯苓比白术多（附子汤白术比茯苓多，白术四茯苓三），最主要是把水利出来，去湿的药开的比较少，利湿的药开的比较多一点。芍药可以去腹痛，炮附子可以去里寒，同时也可以去腹痛。八升就当成八碗，煮成三碗，把渣丢掉，一天三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-ir8ajr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-ir8ajr8","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤方加减法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-wxoxdxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-wxoxdxv","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"若咳者，加五味子半升，细辛、干姜各一两。若小便利者，去茯苓。若下利者，去芍药，加干姜二两。若呕者，去附子，加生姜，足前成半斤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162750-ps4enca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162750-ps4enca","updated":"20240312162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果有咳嗽加五味子，一般来说五味子用两钱或者三钱都可以。五味子治咳非常好，但是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五味子治咳，是里面有水气的时候，引起的咳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。干姜能够温中，因为里面有水，干姜是胃，细辛是下焦，肚子。所以麻黄附子细辛汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下焦的寒湿靠细辛来升提阳气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果小便很利，我们知道茯苓是利尿，把茯苓拿掉。如果拉肚子很严重，把芍药去掉。芍药活血化瘀的动能有，又有滋阴的功能，下痢很严重的，可以把芍药拿掉，加干姜下去，干姜能温中。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"若呕者去附子加生姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，恶心出来的时候，用生姜，因为这个是代表胃里面有水，干姜已经有了，还要用生姜，干姜是温中，但是干姜不能去胃里面的停水，还有恶心的时候我们要用生姜。前面已经有生姜了，再加重，跟前面合起来有半斤，大概四五片生姜，也可以多一点。"}]}]}